'''Ranger [[Istani armor]]''' is an art type available in the Nightfall campaign, as starter armor, [[collector]] armor for the region of [[Istan]], and as regular crafted armor. The collector mask is only available with a [[Marksmanship]] +1 bonus.

There is no [[Prestige armor|prestige]] version of Istani armor.

